<title>USA: Leap says acquires YAR for $20 mln cash.</title>
<headline>Leap says acquires YAR for $20 mln cash.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leap Group Inc said it acquired YAR Communications Inc, an advertising agency, for $20 million in cash.</p>
<p>New York-based YAR had 1996 revenues of $18.5 million in revenues, said Leap, a communications holding company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
